    "taxGuide.denmark.eligibilitySummary": "Traveller eligibility. The ordinary route is for holiday travellers resident outside the EU; people studying, working or stationed in Denmark or another EU country may not qualify. Shops participate voluntarily, issue a compliant invoice, and refund only after receiving customs validated evidence. Goods must accompany the traveller, leave the EU by the official third-month deadline, and checked baggage routed directly outside the EU may require Danish validation before bag drop within the official four-hour window. If the last EU departure is another member state, validation belongs to that final exit customs office. Norway and Åland residents follow a separate higher-threshold import-VAT proof procedure, not the ordinary Danish threshold.",
